			description: ["Cobblestone and two sticks. The Stone Wand extends what you click.", "", "Hold blocks in your offhand or inventory, click a block face, and the wand", "repeats that block along the face until it runs out of range or material.", "", "Deepslate cobble works too if that is what you have."]
