			id: "B15313D0FFA158FA"
			title: "Put A Tool In It"
			description: ["Copper Wand. Now open the Wand Menu (bind it in Controls -> Building Wands).", "", "Version 3 wands hold a TOOL. Drop a pickaxe, shovel or axe into the wand's", "tool slot -- without one, Destroy and Replace actions refuse to run and you", "get 'No tool -- add a tool to wand'. The tool takes the durability.", "", "The four Actions are Place, Replace, Destroy and Use."]
