			title: "The Palette"
			description: ["An item frame and a chest. The Palette holds a set of blocks and feeds them", "to the wand instead of a single block type.", "", "Palette Mode cycles how it picks: Sequential walks the list in order,", "Random scatters, Gradient blends across the build.", "", "This is how you get mixed stone walls without placing anything by hand."]
